  <book code="1TH" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:47:40 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">1 Thessalonians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thư Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka Thưq yưk</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Th</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Phao-lô, ji Sin-vanh, kung dii Ti-mô-thê atăq ăm Tayuup Vah Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka đom Kơy Plêêk, laa Vaq ji Lôôk, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. Apôôy vanong plêêk ji varơuq hrok hrol măn tol oh ay.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />'Wot hloay kuh kway Kơy Plêêk truh dêq hloay ay oh, tuôôy leh padơy nhăk truh oh ay đom kaluh apok apôôy ku 'wot, <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />vii văch truh varơuq dơơp bơyh xuum tuôq, ji varơuq pơơl hwơơl bơyh xuum xung xiaq, kung katik kajưk bơyh varơuq takôô gamưh ku oh ay aduq Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, kangưưr Kơy Plêêk, Vaq haay; <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />vii xet oh ay, khơl adro jah Kơy Plêêk xung xiaq, oh ay jah Kơy Plêêk rơơlh xok, <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />bơyh kơq Hêêl Kaxay ku 'wot heq jah padoh taboon ka oh ay leh vơ bơơn apok đnooy, đơu kung bơơn taay yaak ji bơơn Kơy Phool Hiel, kung dii xuum tuôq kajưk dik — đaji oh ay xet 'wot heq riirh đaleq đom katul oh ay vii ich lơơy ku oh ay. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Oh ay kung heq vlôh jêêk khơl adro tyauq atôôlh ku 'wot ji ku Lôôk, tuôôy nhonq xok đaauq đom katul 'ngưng pơơl hwơơl dii varơuq hlah hlaak ku Lôôk Phool Hiel. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Pheq đnooy, oh ay heq vlôh jêêk ramil ka dêq hloay khơl adro e xuum tuôq aduq Ma-xê-đoan ji aduq A-chai <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Vii xing oh ay, đaauq Lôôk heq jah ahna vlôh, leh vơ đom dêh Ma-xê-đoan ji đom dêh A-chai, bơh xuum tuôq ku oh ay aduq Kơy Plêêk heq pahêêr truh loch aduq. Vii anưq, 'wot leh hloq duh pheq đnooy kajoq đnoyq. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Bơyh tuôôy nhăk truh 'wot, kadih oot ragơy taboon hlê varơuq tiip đoonq đơu 'wot heq e aduq oh ay vlôh aleq, ji đaleq oh ay heq wih klơlh vangưl, wih xuq Kơy Plêêk xôq hơu varơuq Kơy Plêêk hloay riirh ji dong dik, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />ji xôq takôô Koot Kadraq xing plêêk, Kơy đơu Kadraq heq khienq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt — nưq laa Lôôk Jê-xu, Kơy wơơt haay klơlh đơơt tôq jaraq đong truh.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Wơơy oh ay, kadih oh ay xet đaneq varơuq 'wot truh kung oh ay heq be vlôh jêêk hlo hloh. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Bơh atêq tuôôy chiuq pơơl ji biq đnooy ra ơơh aduq theng Phi-lip tyauq đaji oh ay heq xet, 'wot jah kôk lơyq đom Kơy Plêêk ku 'wot xôq padoh taboon ka oh ay Hêêl Kaxay ku Kơy Plêêk katul 'ngưng varơuq tachơơl hlê. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Vii varơuq ahmưk nhăk ku 'wot leh aalq vlôh xing varơuq leh troq, kung leh truh xing xuum lưp xarêh, long bơyh varơuq adô aluut, <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />bơh 'wot heq jah Kơy Plêêk ta'meq xôq jah pahnăp Hêêl Kaxay đaleq, yôôych 'wot kung đnooy vlôh đanưq, leh aalq xôq dơơp hlah xuum khơl kadrơy, đơu xôq dơơp hlah xuum Kơy Plêêk, laa Kơy arơơk 'yo xuum 'wot. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Đaji oh ay heq xet, tuôôy nưq 'wot leh truh bơơn kaluh apok adô adeng, long bơyh xuum hmưch padu kadook — Kơy Plêêk dơơp xanưk — <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />kung leh axek akhiim tađnah tađnaak xing koot manih, be aalq xing oh ay long xing khơl kadrơy, <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />tabơh hnoq ik jah vado kôt vii laa khơl jah rơơlh ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, bơh măn katul oh ay, 'wot đaji laa pa iir vlôh khơl oh de, đêh kajoq adro miq duh pheq jư 'yo koot ni. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Vii xiaq trôôch oh ay đanưq, lunưq 'wot hlah xuum ahlook dii oh ay leh vơ Hêêl Kaxay ku Kơy Plêêk, đơu măn xăk riirh ku kadih 'wot. Nưq laa jo oh ay heq vlôh jêêk khơl manih xung xiaq đôôyq dii 'wot. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Wơơy oh ay, dik laa oh ay măn văch varơuq galeh galal ji pơơl hwơơl ku 'wot, 'wot heq padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay ku Kơy Plêêk ka oh ay tuôôy măn dơơp varơuq klôôy hngơy xôq leh dơơp gengq parêq ka dêq hloay kơyq đom oh ay. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Oh ay laa khơl dơơp xanưk, ji hloay Kơy Plêêk đnoyq, đaneq đôôyq dii oh ay, laa khơl adro e xuum tuôq, 'wot heq riirh hlăng vah, hyioh jăk, ji leh e aduq trek ik vlôh aleq, <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />kung đaji oh ay heq xet, đaleq 'wot đôôyq dii tôôy muuyq adro đom oh ay, đaji adro vaq đôôyq dii koot xau ni, <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />pa nhăk oh ay, ahmưk nhăk ji ahluk ahlul oh ay xôq xa măn kach taxưngq dii Kơy Plêêk, Kơy taayh oh ay muut đom daak plêêk ji tađnah tađnaak ku Kadraq.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Vii kơq nưq, 'wot kung leh padơy kuh kway Kơy Plêêk, vii tuôôy nhonq xok apok Kơy Plêêk xing varơuq xaam tameng aduq 'wot, oh ay heq đoonq nhonq leh aalq đaji apok ku koot manih, đơu tyauq dong dik nưq laa apok ku Kơy Plêêk, kung laa varơuq đong dơơp đom oh ay, nưq laa đom khơl adro e xuum tuôq. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Wơơy oh ay, oh ay heq vlôh jêêk khơl adro atôôlh tyauq kaluh tayuup vah ku Kơy Plêêk, laa kaluh tayuup vah đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu măn aduq dêh Ju-đê, vii oh ay heq chiuq kung kaluh pơơl hwơơl xing kadih tamooy oh ay, dang đaji kaluh tayuup vah nưq kung heq chiuq xing manih Jo Thaiq, <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />laa khơl adro heq vơơ păk kaxêêt Lôôk, laa Lôôk Jê-xu, kung khơl kơy hlit, vơơ rôp toop 'wot, ji kung laa khơl adro be dơơp hlah xuum Kơy Plêêk, laay măn tachơơl hlê dii tôôy adro, <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />tuôôy kơmq klơl 'wot padoh taboon ka tamooy kadrơy xôq 'ngưng adro hnoq ik jah wơơt, jarooy truh kadrôôp maroh ku oot kưq hloay lôp viik athêêp. Bơh truh lôôch dik, đơơt tôq jaraq hnoq apôôt tol oot.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Wơơy oh ay, long biq aklah xangưưy dii oh ay đom muuyq kawah kawat, ju xangưưy mot bơh leh xangưưy xuum, 'wot dêq paraat pơl wol đom xuum trôôch dong dik xôq tavơh mot oh ay. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Lunưq, 'wot xung hooy truh dii oh ay — nhưk laa gô, Phao-lô, muuyq vaarq yưk xung hooy — bơh Sa-tan heq klơl hlê 'wot. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Vii varơuq takôô gamưh, long varơuq hlah hlaak, long đoat tađnah tađnaak ku 'wot laa kajoq? Be aalq nưq laa oh ay măn kangưưr Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Jê-xu, đom varơuq rama truh ku Kadraq long aleq? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Dik, oh ay laa tađnah tađnaak ji varơuq hlah hlaak ku 'wot.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Jo nưq, tuôôy leh chiuq xiik iaq ik, 'wot biit tolh iaq laa muuyq adro pheq biq măn hlê aduq A-thên, <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />ji 'wot heq patăk dăt Ti-mô-thê, adro oh ay ku 'wot ji xapok ku Kơy Plêêk đom Hêêl Kaxay ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, xôq dơơp kajưk kalh ji ahmưk nhăk oh ay truh xuum tuôq ku oh ay, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />xôq leh kơyq biq anhưh ahrưng katul kaluh pơơl dal neq. Vii kadih oh ay xet đaneq haay jah đinq tangưưr varơuq đanưq. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Pheq đnooy tuôôy 'wot đong măn dii oh ay, 'wot heq đnooy adroyq ka oh ay đaneq haay hnoq chiuq pơơl dal, ji varơuq xalih vlôh dang đaji oh ay heq xet. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Vii liq jo nưq, tuôôy leh hno chiuq xiik iaq ik đnoyq, gô heq patăk manih hooy xôq xet xuum tuôq oh ay đaleq, xet 'leq adro adô aluut bơơn kach leq nưq heq adô adeng oh ay ji varơuq dơơp ku 'wot jêêk vlôh hlo hloh. <verse eid="1TH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Bơh hloay tuôôy neq, Ti-mô-thê, atêq tuôôy hooy xing aduq oh ay xuq dii 'wot, heq taway ka 'wot hêêl hlah truh xuum tuôq ji xuum xung xiaq ku oh ay, đaneq oh ay hloay jư kaluh duut noor kaxay tamaq truh 'wot, takôô trôôch tavơh 'wot kung dang đaji 'wot trôôch tavơh oh ay. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Vii liq jo nưq, wơơy oh ay, 'wot jah hlơq hlôôp xing oh ay tuôôy tangưưr dii tôôy hiêmh ngwi ji pơơl dal ku oh ay, vii xuum tuôq ku oh ay. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Jauq xing tuôôy neq, atoh kadih oh ay dưk kajưk đom Lôôk, yôôych 'wot riirh. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />'Wot hnoq ik tơơk tưp Kơy Plêêk apok kuh kway đaleq truh oh ay gamưh tol dêq hloay xuum mưng me đơu vii kơq oh ay, 'wot hlah hlaak kangưưr Kơy Plêêk 'wot, <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />klôôy hngơy apôôy dêq xuum xôq jah tavơh mot oh ay ji ăm athêêp kaluh kajoq măn thiuq đom xuum tuôq oh ay?<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Apôôy vôôch kadih Kơy Plêêk, Vaq haay, ji Lôôk Jê-xu, Lôôk haay, jarooy trôôk 'wot truh kung oh ay. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Apôôy Lôôk khienq oh ay athêêp tok ji raah jôh đom xuum xung xiaq đôôyq dii mamuuyq ji đôôyq dii tôôy adro, kung đaji kach 'wot đôôyq dii oh ay, <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />xôq dơơp ka xuum oh ay kajưk kalh, leh e kajoq đangq trek đom varơuq hlăng vah kangưưr Kơy Plêêk, Vaq haay, đom varơuq rama truh ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Jê-xu, kung dii dêq hloay khơl vah Kadraq. Amen!<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Vii anưq, atêq lôôch, wơơy oh ay, 'wot apôôy xiin ji ahmưk nhăk oh ay đom Lôôk, laa Lôôk Jê-xu, dang đaji oh ay heq nhonq xok xing 'wot đaleq laa varơuq duh dik ka oh ay xôq riirh ji dơơp kaxay xuum Kơy Plêêk, kung đaji kach oh ay đong riirh, xôq ka oh ay hnoq ik kahluh truh iaq đnoyq. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Vii oh ay xet kaluh padoh pato leq 'wot heq pato ka oh ay bơyh Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Vii neq laa iq trôôch ku Kơy Plêêk, nưq laa varơuq yuôôr vah ku oh ay: pheq jư xăk chuh xangưưy varơuq apuq atrăp; <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />tôôy dro đom oh ay pheq xet jư 'yo xăk xamơk haay đom varơuq hlăng vah ji jah vado, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />leh dơơp tyauq ham trôôch bơyq ba (dang đaji manih tamooy kadrơy laa adro leh xet Kơy Plêêk); <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />xôq te kơyq lôp kadrôôp ji adô aluut oh ay ni đom ka varơuq neq, bơyh vii Lôôk laa Kơy dơơp bla hlê truh tôôy varơuq nưq, đaji 'wot kung heq đnooy adroyq ji dong dik đnooy nhăk ka oh ay. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Vii Kơy Plêêk leh taayh tawooyh haay truh varơuq klơơr 'yêq, bơh muut đom varơuq yuôôr vah. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Vii anưq, kơyq chôôyq ka'lăk pato hok neq leh aalq chôôyq ka'lăk koot manih, đơu laa chôôyq ka'lăk Kơy Plêêk, Kơy kahniq Lôôk Phool Hiel Kadraq ka oh ay.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Măn truh varơuq oh ay xung xiaq mamuuyq, oh ay be duh 'wot valơk ka oh ay, vii kadih oh ay jah Kơy Plêêk pato pheq xung xiaq mamuuyq. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Vii dik, oh ay e dơơp đanưq đôôyq dii dêq hloay oh ay đom dih dêh Ma-xê-đoan. Bơh wơơy oh ay, 'wot ahmưk nhăk oh ay kưq kahluh truh iaq đnoyq, <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />ji pheq raanq paraat riirh hrok hrol, jư 'yo kaluh varơuq ku oh ay, kadih ti oh ay dơơp, đaji 'wot heq patăk pato oh ay, <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />xôq oh ay hnoq ik xa măn kach hyioh troq kangưưr manih xadaay ji leh e thiuq kajoq.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Wơơy oh ay, 'wot leh trôôch oh ay be xet kajoq truh khơl adro đong vik, xôq oh ay klơlh hlu xuum đaji khơl manih kadrơy laa khơl adro leh e varơuq takôô gamưh. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Vii atoh haay tuôq đaneq Lôôk Jê-xu heq kaxêêt ji heq riirh hlê, yôôych Kơy Plêêk kung hnoq taway khơl adro heq vik truh dii Kadraq gamưh Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Gamưh muut apok ku Lôôk, 'wot đnooy varơuq neq ka oh ay, đaneq haay, khơl manih măn đong riirh, khơl manih e măn hlê dong truh tuôôy Lôôk pôôt dêh, kajưk dik leh hooy adroyq khơl manih heq vik. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Vii kadih Lôôk hnoq xing plêêk kahri pôôt dii hlêêl tanưưl, dii apok ku kơy yaak ưk, kung dii hnưm keeng ku Kơy Plêêk, yôôch khơl adro heq kaxêêt đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh hnoq riirh hlê adroyq dêq. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Xatyauq truh, haay, laa khơl manih măn đong riirh, khơl manih e măn hlê, hnoq jah taway tok kung dii oot đom đum kluk xôq tavơh Lôôk tol lawah plêêk, ji đanưq, haay hnoq măn dii Lôôk hloay hloay. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Jo nưq, dayh hlơq hlôôp mamuuyq bơơn kaluh apok neq.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Wơơy oh ay, truh hngơy wat ji katuôôy, oh ay be duh 'wot valơk ka oh ay. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Vii kadih oh ay xet thier ro đaneq hngơy ku Lôôk truh dang đaleq — đaji adro atôk đom kamơng. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Tuôôy khơl kadrơy đnooy: “Tagu hlê ji hrok hrol,” yôôych varơuq kaxêêt hlơơp tưng hưng ka ôp pôôt tol oot, dang đaji đơơt jiq pa iir đôôyq dii khơl kadrê đong măn bonq, ji oot kajưk dik leh xaloot klơlh. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Bơh, wơơy oh ay, oh ay leh măn đom kamơng jaluk xôq yôôch hngơy nưq xalih truh ka oh ay tưng hưng đaji adro atôk. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Vii oh ay raay laa koot ku xaraar tađnah ji koot ku ka hngơy. Haay leh thuôk xuq ka klôôy long kamơng jaluk, <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Vii anưq, haay te vik đaji khơl adro kadrơy, wih hlê, haay duh parol 'yo ji talăng jăk. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Vii manih vik laa vik đom ka klôôy, ji manih vuul yôôych vuul đom ka klôôy. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Bơh vii thuôk xuq ka hngơy, lunưq haay pheq talăng jăk, hlưp aau kanăk ku xuum tuôq ji xuum xung xiaq, dii đoat kanăk — laa takôô gamưh wơơt xok. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Vii Kơy Plêêk heq leh đinq ka haay chiuq đơơt tôq tơh, đơu xôq nhonq jah varơuq wơơt xok gamưh Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Kơy heq kaxêêt vii haay, xôq haay long parol long vik, haay raay kung riirh dii Kadraq. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Jo nưq, dayh ahmưk nhăk mamuuyq, adro neq dayh waak rơy adro hơq, đaji oh ay đong măn dơơp.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Wơơy oh ay, 'wot xiin oh ay dayh kul vado khơl adro chiuq pơơl hwơơl katul đom oh ay, jarooy achôôk oh ay đom Lôôk, ahmưk nhăk oh ay, <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />ji dayh biit truh oot muuyq kach vanê vado đom xuum xung xiaq vii varơuq dơơp ku oot. Dayh riirh tagu dii mamuuyq. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Panưh kadrơy, wơơy oh ay, 'wot ahluk ahlul oh ay: pheq trek toah manih xa măn bơyq ba, pheq hlơq hlôôp manih gưlh xuum, pheq waak rôôk manih ravoch, pheq atuq xuum dii dêq hloay tôôy adro. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Dayh rơơt rol, te kơyq xok xơk bla xơk ka kơyq, wih hlê, dayh hloay chawiq tyauq varơuq kaxay tamaq deng ka mamuuyq ji ka tôôy adro. <verse eid="1TH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Dayh hloay hloay hlah hlaak. <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Dayh apôôy leh padơy. <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />Đom baq kê varơuq kajoq, dayh kuh kway, vii varơuq nưq laa xuum trôôch ku Kơy Plêêk deng ka oh ay đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="1TH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Te apoch Kơy Phool Hiel. <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />Te 'yo leh ra kajoq kaluh apok hlit. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Dayh arơơk axek tôôy varơuq. Dayh jư xok varơuq kajoq laa tamaq kaxay. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Dayh chuh xangưưy klơlh tôôy varơuq dang đaji varơuq xơk tauq.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Apôôy vôôch jơq Kơy Plêêk hrok hrol yuôôr vah oh ay dêq hloay, ji apôôy dêq hloay danưng kooy, phool hiel, xăk xamơk ku oh ay jah jư 'yo ăm leh e aduq trek ik tuôôy Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, kahri truh. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Jư apok thay laa Kơy tawooyh taayh oh ay, kung laa Kơy hnoq dưk dơơp varơuq nưq.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Wơơy oh ay, kung dayh apôôy ka 'wot đnoyq.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Xiin vôôch hlơq dêq hloay oh ay bơơn hiip vah. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Gô taayh yal Lôôk dăt ka oh ay pheq xôq hla thư neq jah đok ka dêq hloay oh ay.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Apôôy vôôch vanong plêêk ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, măn kung oh ay.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>